			"Message": "docs(Worker): Update getting started link to Building.md\n\nUpdate the 'Getting Started' section in README.md to reference the specific `Documentation/GitHub/Building.md` file within the main Land repository instead of pointing to the root README. This change directs developers to the dedicated build instructions while clarifying that the Worker is a core component of the Land project.\n\nThis refinement ensures users land on the correct, detailed build guide for the editor's web worker layer.",
